Z||000012||Nashco||09-24-2001||01:15 AM||||Wow, who's shop Lisa!?  I'm totally jealous...I just worked with caveman equipment doing my front suspension rebuild, swearing the whole time about all the stuff I didn't have.  I used to use dad's huge tool box stocked, all the best air tools, lights, creeper, stroller stool...I was so spoiled!  Having the right equipment makes the job take half the time, at least!  Ah..fender covers, four jackstands, flat clean floor...I'M SO JEALOUS!  Glad you like the swap  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Bryce<BR>88 GT<P>Stupid typos...<p>[This message has been edited by Nashco (edited 09-24-2001).]||||reg||1
